正在调用 DeepSeek：SQL Generation……

模型生成的 SQL：
SELECT stadium.Name
FROM stadium
LEFT JOIN concert ON stadium.Stadium_ID = concert.Stadium_ID
WHERE concert.concert_ID IS NULL;

Gold SQL（仅用于核对）：
SELECT name FROM stadium WHERE stadium_id NOT IN (SELECT stadium_id FROM concert)

